  "d.th2bvi": "Segmentonaka, nayrt'ata: L1, laya id, hull digito + escudo digito, sami, arma uchañ chiqa tokenanaka, nave id, nave hull digito + nave escudo digito, nave arma uchañ chiqa tokenanaka. Samix STOCK ukataki '-', paleta entry k ukataki 'p<k>', jan ukax suxta lower-case hex digito. Mä segmentox stock ukhamawa '00' (tiernaka), '-' (sami, nave) jan ukax ch'usa (arma uchañ chiqanaka) ukhaxa; tukuñ stock ukhamäki ukatsti sapa stock segmento apsutawa, nayra ukanakax qhiparapxi. Nave segmentonakax hangar utani layaki utji. Layax jan katuqkaspa ajllt'awix STOCK ukham liyi.",
  "d.tjh47s": "Junt'u sapa tama tiruñ ukamp jiltaski; armanakax mä límite ukan sinti junt'upxi, ukat juk'ampi límite manqhan mayampi sumaptapxi.",
